# MEMORY (THIN)

Chat dies. `HANDOFF.md` = durable session state. Optional: Obsidian vault via MCP for long-lived graph memory.

## LOCAL (default — always works)
- Start: read `HANDOFF.md` tail for current objective + state.
- During: durable fact → update `HANDOFF.md` or a local `.md` note.
- End: update `HANDOFF.md` with Goal/Done-when/Residual; compact if >150 lines.

## OPTIONAL OBSIDIAN (if MCP `user-obsidian` is configured)
- Start: `vault_read` `wiki/hot.md` then `wiki/index.md` then project Index + Sessions.
- During: durable fact → `vault_append` (not stubs).
- End: Session Goal/Done-when/Residual; refresh `wiki/hot.md`; mirror `HANDOFF.md`.
- Never edit `raw/`.

## PROCEDURE
Obsidian workflows, ingest/query/lint:
**Read `~/.cursor/skills/obsidian-memory/SKILL.md`** when memory work is non-trivial.
